# Spec 017 AC-8, automatic (spec 013): play a little (screenshots), open the controls screen, reset everything,
# rebind jump to B (a swap with attack), reset jump, rebind it to Y, leave (save), press Y and A in play, reload the
# bindings from the file (same checksum), run the bench; the example ends with "actions: PASS 7/7". Only controls
# every 3DS has. Repeatable: a saved file from an earlier run is reset by "reset all".
# PC:      nnh run actions --pc --script examples/actions/tests/check.nnhs
# Console: nnh run actions --script examples/actions/tests/check.nnhs   (Homebrew Launcher open, press Y)
fail-on "] E "
fail-on "actions: FAIL"

# The playfield: move right while charging an attack, then let go (the shot flies).
wait 20
screenshot play
press B
stick circle 1 0
wait 40
screenshot charging
release B
stick circle 0 0
wait 20
screenshot shot

# The controls screen (START), everything back to the defaults.
tap START
expect "actions: pause pressed" 10
wait 10
tap Y
expect "actions: reset all" 10
wait 10

# Rebind jump (second item) to B: attack had B, so they swap.
tap DOWN
tap A
wait 4
tap B
expect "actions: rebind jump -> B (swapped with attack)" 10
wait 10
screenshot swapped

# Reset jump (A again; attack keeps A from the swap), then rebind it to Y and leave: the bindings are saved.
tap X
expect "actions: reset jump" 10
wait 10
tap A
wait 4
tap Y
expect "actions: rebind jump -> Y" 10
wait 10
tap B
expect "actions: saved 40 bytes sum" 10
wait 10

# Play with the new controls: Y jumps, A attacks.
tap Y
expect "actions: jump pressed" 10
wait 10
tap A
expect "actions: attack pressed" 10
wait 10

# Back in the controls screen: reload the file (same checksum as saved), then the bench and the verdict.
tap START
wait 10
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap DOWN
tap A
expect "actions: reloaded 2 applied 0 skipped sum" 10
wait 10
tap DOWN
tap A
expect "actions: bench started" 10
expect "actions: bench avg" 700
expect "actions: PASS 7/7" 10
wait 10
screenshot verdict
end
